# MaCSad admin invariants

This import-free leaf owns the existing six-column board and terminal-state
rules independently of transport and rendering.

## To invariantKanbanColumnCount () -> Int:
    Return 6.

## To invariantClosedAcceptsOrdinaryWork (anyCommand: Bool) -> Bool:
    Return false.

## Test: Column count stays six
    Expect that invariantKanbanColumnCount() is 6.

## Test: Closed is terminal
    For all booleans anyCommand:
        Let accepted be invariantClosedAcceptsOrdinaryWork(anyCommand).
        Expect that accepted is equal to false.
